{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9fd15fc8-c040-82db-a3e9-310a7bf56f75",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T10:58:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leila Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:53:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:53:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, hi. I'm calling about a Christmas tree. Is the city still picking those up? Because mine is still sitting out at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:53:25-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still picking them up, okay. Let me just pull up the schedule here. Where's the tree sitting, what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:53:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 86 Broadway. Up in the North End. [line breaks up] ...the curb out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:53:48-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up on me there. 86 Broadway, North End, tree's at the curb. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:54:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 86 Broadway. Sorry, my signal is terrible. I'm standing out by the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:54:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. So how long has it been out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:54:16-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since, um, the second week of January, maybe? I put it out when the sign said to. And then the storm came, the snow and then the rain, Sunday into Monday, and now it's just a soggy, icy mess out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:54:41-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Soggy, icy mess, yep. Okay, so tree's been out about two weeks, goes in my notes. Let me see what the route says for the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:54:58-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The route says. Okay. Is there a fee for it? Because I'd honestly be annoyed if I had to pay to get it taken away after I already did everything right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:55:18-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A fee, no, there's no charge for the tree pickup, it's part of the regular service. As long as it's just the tree, no bag around it, no stand, no tinsel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:55:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bag, no stand. Right, no, it's just the tree. Bare. I took the lights off and everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:55:49-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Then it's just a matter of getting a crew to it. Let me put in a request for 86 Broadway. [pause] Yeah, what I'm seeing is the pickups got pushed around by the storm, so some streets are behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:56:14-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Behind. So when is that going to be? Because I have a ride coming in twenty minutes and I'm going to be gone most of the day, so I can't really, like, stand here and wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:56:36-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ride in twenty minutes, got it. You don't have to be there. Just leave it where it is, at the curb, not in the snowbank if you can help it. Can you drag it a little closer to the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:57:01-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Closer to the road. Yeah, I can do that before I go. It's kind of frozen to the ground a little, but I can yank it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:57:18-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, yeah, give it a good tug. I'll note that it's out front, clear of the snow. Do you want a call back when it's done, or you good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:57:36-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call back. No, I don't need a call back. I just want it gone. If it's still there by the end of the week, I'll call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:57:54-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. I'd say give it until the end of the week, and if it's still there, call us and mention today's request so we can track it. Anything else going on with your pickup, regular trash, recycling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:58:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Regular trash. Um, no, that was fine this week. It's just the tree. [crosstalk] ...oh, my ride's here early."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:58:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go, go, don't keep them waiting. I've got 86 Broadway, tree at the curb, no fee, request is in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:58:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Request is in. Okay, thanks. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:58:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take care now."
    }
  ],
